       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-STANDARDS-COMPLIANT-NN-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STANDARDS-COMPLIANCE-MATRIX.
           05  WS-RULE-1-AUNCIENT-SPELL    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-2-NO-BINARIES-GIT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-3-NO-PRATTLING      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-4-NO-BROWSER-AUTO   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-5-SCSI-KEYCODES     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-6-WINDOW-TRACKING   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-7-NO-MOCKS-INTEROP  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-8-FILE-SIZE-68KB    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-9-DYNAMIC-ADDR-ZMM  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-10-FET-DISCHARGE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-11-LATENCY-GUARD    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-12-NO-CHILD-LANG    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-13-DAT-BIN-ONLY     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-14-DISPLACE-SHADER  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-15-GLOSSARY-TRIPART PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-16-TEDDY_BEAR-PARTICIPNT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-17-NO-MERMAID       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-18-NO-PROHIBITED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-19-NO-RDF           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-20-NO-BROTLI        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SYSTEM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-TOTAL-COMPLIANCE-SOUND   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-ASSERT-HARDWARE-STANDARDS.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-CAJAL-NEURON-STANDARDS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-COMPLIANCE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-ASSERT-HARDWARE-STANDARDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-5-SCSI-KEYCODES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-10-FET-DISCHARGE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-13-DAT-BIN-ONLY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-14-DISPLACE-SHADER.
       2000-ASSERT-CAJAL-NEURON-STANDARDS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-7-NO-MOCKS-INTEROP.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-8-FILE-SIZE-68KB.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-18-NO-PROHIBITED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-20-NO-BROTLI.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-COMPLIANCE.
           IF WS-RULE-1-AUNCIENT-SPELL = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-2-NO-BINARIES-GIT = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-5-SCSI-KEYCODES = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-7-NO-MOCKS-INTEROP = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-8-FILE-SIZE-68KB = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-10-FET-DISCHARGE = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-11-LATENCY-GUARD = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-12-NO-CHILD-LANG = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-13-DAT-BIN-ONLY = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-14-DISPLACE-SHADER = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-16-TEDDY_BEAR-PARTICIPNT = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-18-NO-PROHIBITED = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-19-NO-RDF = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-20-NO-BROTLI = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-COMPLIANCE-SOUND
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-COMPLIANCE-SOUND.
